# machine-drafted, needs native review
# Vet, orthopaedic and cephalometric geometry in the measuring tool. Every point is placed
# by hand; nothing is detected or graded.

measure-tool-geometry = 几何测量
measure-tool-hint-geometry = 选择模板，然后依次放置它要求的各个点。
measure-tool-template = 模板：{ $name }

geometry-prompt = { $template }，第 { $n } 点，共 { $total } 点：{ $point }
geometry-readout = { $name }：{ $value }
geometry-value-angle = { $value }°
geometry-value-vertebrae = { $value } 个椎体
geometry-extrapolated = { $value }（超出 T9，估算）
geometry-degenerate = 点距离太近或在一条直线上。请移动一个点。
geometry-moved = 点已移动。{ $value }
# machine-drafted, needs native review
geometry-picked = 已拾起 { $point }。方向键移动它，按住 Shift 步长更大。空格键放下，Esc 放回原处。
geometry-put-back = 点已放回原处。

